  "name": "Mythic+ keystone bricks when its owner leaves the instance (#7354)",
  "contract": [
    "#7354: leaving the zone during a keystone run used to brick the key, stop the timer and downgrade it;",
    "the run kept going instead. When the keystone's owner leaves the instance the run stops (state 2, no more timer",
    "updates) and the key stays at the level it lost at the start. Another member leaving, or the owner relogging, does",
    "not stop it."
  ],
